# This directory contains feature modules following the modular monolith architecture
# 
# Module structure:
# src/modules/
#   [domain]/
#     components/     - UI components specific to this domain
#     hooks/          - React hooks for data fetching and state
#     lib/            - Utility functions and helpers
#     types/          - TypeScript types and interfaces
#     index.ts        - Public API barrel export
#
# Modules:
# - products      - Product catalog, ECMS import, images
# - inventory     - Stock management, transfers, adjustments
# - suppliers     - Supplier management
# - users         - User management, invitations
# - branches      - Branch management
# - categories    - Category taxonomy
# - services      - Service offerings
